            "id": 76588,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bu kod ne görüntüler?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"name = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Sue&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" name == \" /><text value=\"&quot;Sue&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Hi Sue!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Hi Sue!\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>Hi Sue!</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Hiçbir şey, koşul <code>False</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>Sue</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>Hi Sue!</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bu kod neden <code>Hi Sue!</code> görüntüler?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"name = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Sue&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" name == \" /><text value=\"&quot;Sue&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Hi Sue!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Hi Sue!\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Karşılaştırma <code>True</code> olduğu için girintili <code>print()</code> çalışır.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Karşılaştırma <code>name</code> değerini <code>\"Sue\"</code> olarak değiştirir.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>print()</code> blok dışında olduğu için koşuldan bağımsız olarak çalışır.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Karşılaştırma <code>True</code> olduğu için girintili <code>print()</code> çalışır.</p></body></html>"
